re it to item selected, the overflowed numbers print negative ints without issue.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888360379/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888435748","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106518#issuecomment-2888435748","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106518","id":2888435748,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sKggk","user":{"login":"Malthbern","id":61102919,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxMTAyOTE5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61102919?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Malthbern","html_url":"https://github.com/Malthbern","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Malthbern/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Malthbern/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Malthbern/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Malthbern/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Malthbern/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Malthbern/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Malthbern/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Malthbern/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Malthbern/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-17T14:45:20Z","updated_at":"2025-05-17T14:45:20Z","body":"> Hm, I'm not actually able to reproduce the issue, and looking at the code I don't see a problem with negative numbers. The only number that's treated specially is -1. What am I supposed to be looking for in the MRP? If I do something like\n> \n> ```\n> func _on_item_selected(index: int) -> void:\n>     print(optionbutton.get_item_id(index))\n> ```\n> \n> and wire it to item selected, the overflowed numbers print negative ints without issue.\n\nif that's the case not sure if this might be a mono specific issue or just something weird about the build on the manjaro official repo. but when an int overflows the id sets itself to 0\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/58f441b9-2943-470b-9ab2-41e172f038d5)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888435748/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888480859","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106518#issuecomment-2888480859","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106518","id":2888480859,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sKrhb","user":{"login":"precup","id":709680,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTY4MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/709680?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup","html_url":"https://github.com/precup","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/precup/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-17T16:25:43Z","updated_at":"2025-05-17T16:25: